  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/langs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e (tree-sitter-language-pack 0.13.0): a two-Struct fixture with external fields yields class Cfg plus `field Cfg.Cfg2`, i.e. the second class is swallowed and mis-kinded as a field. sherpa_onnx_bindings.dart still gives field SherpaOnnxOfflineTtsModelConfig.SherpaOnnxOfflineTtsConfig (288) and field SherpaOnnxOfflineModelConfig.SherpaOnnxOfflineRecognizerConfig (504), with 102 ERROR nodes. Fix option (c) is already done: run.failed_files records the file as partial_parse. MECHANISM: grammar gap on dart:ffi external field declarations; error recovery re-parents following declarations. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: INV-bisok."  # 8d07
